{"availability":"available","full":"WhiteBite/Domain-Hunter","name":"Domain-Hunter","description":"Check bulk domain availability 100% in your browser — free, open-source RDAP domain checker & name generator. 140+ TLDs, live registrar prices, TLD hacks, CSV export. No servers, no API keys, no tracking.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":23,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-17T09:46:45Z","updated":"2026-10-07T00:29:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://whitebite.github.io/Domain-Hunter/","topics":["client-side","csv","dns","domain-availability","domain-checker","domain-generator","domain-name","domain-names","domain-search","domaining","expired-domains","name-generator","offline","privacy-tools","rdap","svelte","tld","typescript","whois","whois-lookup"],"demo":"https://whitebite.github.io/Domain-Hunter/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.517Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.517Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.517Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.517Z","stars":23,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The Drops tab scans expired/dropped domains — the bundled snapshot is refreshed weekly from the WhoisFreaks daily dropped-domains feed — and reports those still available at standard registration price, no aftermarket markups. Star any domain to add it to your watchlist; the app silently re-checks favorited domains on load and flags freed or taken changes.","Some registrars advertise a $0.99 first year but charge $25 to renew. Domain Hunter flags these as promo traps when the renewal price is 5× or more the first-year price. Always check the renewal column and the 3-year TCO, not just the headline price."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WhiteBite/Domain-Hunter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"688cc03b689e74ba00e1ed9445aebc0acf96563241ee86edb197e1d429089f31","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:40.702Z"},"ov